SmartSessionEmissary::verifyExecution
├── given single call execution
│   ├── when signature is valid
│   │   └── it returns verifyExecution selector
│   └── when session validator rejects signature
│       └── it returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
├── given batch call execution
│   └── when all actions are enabled and signature is valid
│       └── it returns verifyExecution selector
├── given digest is cached
│   └── it returns verifyExecution selector without revalidating
├── given caller is not intent executor
│   └── it reverts with UnauthorizedSource
├── given permissionId is invalid
│   └── it reverts with InvalidPermissionId
├── given action selector is not enabled
│   └── it reverts
├── given action target is not enabled
│   └── it reverts
└── given emissary data is empty
    └── it reverts